[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]李傕家族成员（补全）[/font][/b]


[indent]•  [color=#000000]李式[/color]：子，深受其母宠爱（以私情破坏李郭议和）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]李暹（一作李进）[/color]：兄子，副车中郎将，逼献帝离宫至营；与李利"待上无礼"；及李傕首级至许都，献帝诏高悬示众[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]李利[/color]：兄子，与李暹对献帝无礼[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
